  "raw_text": "instead, including the chain and the specific item? And why would that be the closest... User: I'd get a number two meal from McDonald's because that is the second best item on their menu. Agent: Okay, so a number two meal from McDonald's. Could you explain why that particular item is the closest replacement for the Big Mac in your opinion? User: Because it is the second menu item on their menu. Big Mac is the number one. The number two is the second best item on their menu. Agent: I understand that the number two meal is the second item on the menu. To clarify, what specific qualities or characteristics of the number two meal make it the closest replacement... User: It's two cheeseburgers. I don't have to get one cheeseburger. I can get two cheeseburgers, fries, and a drink. That's Philly. Agent: Thank you for that explanation. Now, thinking beyond McDonald's, can you name two or three similar items you also like from any other fast-food chains? And for each of those, could you... Us",
